/Title (The SwiftShip Tracker is designed to provide a centralized Salesforce-based parcel management solution that enables customers to book parcels, track delivery status and manage shipments. The project combines custom Salesforce objects, relationships, Flows, Apex, Email Alerts, Experience Cloud,AgentForce A I, Prompt Builder, security controls and reporting.)
