/Title (The source describes the project as a Salesforce CRM solution supporting the complete parcel lifecycle from booking and dispatch through tracking and delivery confirmation. Its stated purpose is to centralize parcel and delivery information, simplify booking and tracking, provide real-time shipment visibility, and automate delivery updates and customer notifications.)
